esds-no-descriptor.m4a: the ftyp and moov of an M4A ffmpeg made (3 s of
AAC), its mdat emptied, and its esds atom's ES_Descriptor tag, 3, made
0x80, as a fuzzer of the server's decoding found it. symphonia 0.5.5's
MP4 reader panicked on it, unwrapping the descriptor it lacks
(symphonia-format-isomp4, src/atoms/esds.rs:79), which is why the server
decodes such files through ffmpeg, in a process of its own (src/ffmpeg.rs).
No audio is in it: ffmpeg refuses it.
